[mongodb] all_or_nothing => error: |MongoDB has no transaction on a standalone server, so each chunk is kept as it goes.|

[mongodb] transaction_start
  (none)

[mongodb] COMMIT
  |COMMIT|
  = write_on=false select=false classify=ReadWrite [Unreadable] gate ro=Some(Upgrade(ReadWrite)) rw=Some(RunOnce) full=Some(RunOnce) bracket=true

[mongodb] ROLLBACK
  |ROLLBACK|
  = write_on=false select=false classify=ReadWrite [Unreadable] gate ro=Some(Upgrade(ReadWrite)) rw=Some(RunOnce) full=Some(RunOnce) bracket=true
[redis] all_or_nothing => error: |Redis has no transaction that rolls back, so each chunk is kept as it goes.|

